steps.action:
Save this as provision.json, replacing credentials and all addresses with reserved values for the test LAN:
{
  "ssid": "TEST-SSID",
  "password": "TEST-PASSWORD",
  "disableCloud": true,
  "staticIp": {
    "ip": "192.168.1.220",
    "netmask": "255.255.255.0",
    "gateway": "192.168.1.1",
    "dns": "192.168.1.1"
  }
}
Submit: curl --max-time 5 -i -X POST http://192.168.4.1/api/provision -H 'Content-Type: application/json' --data-binary @provision.json

